  "title": "Erdős Problem #208",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $s_1<s_2<\\cdots$ be the sequence of squarefree numbers. Is it true that, for any $\\epsilon>0$ and large $n$, $ s_{n+1}-s_n \\ll_\\epsilon s_n^{\\epsilon}? $ Is it true that $ s_{n+1}-s_n \\leq (1+o(1))\\frac{\\pi^2}{6}\\frac{\\log s_n}{\\log\\log s_n}? $ ",
